        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 138,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "All the kings of the earth will give you thanks, LORD, for they have heard the words of your mouth.",
      "ko": "여호와여 땅의 열왕이 주께 감사할 것은 저희가 주의 입의 말씀을 들음이오며",
      "source_text_hash": "bdbbe5fb7d0a5219e8b31f8c4bafa774b7d62f8da8209f7b3f4b3e474aeee66c",
      "translation_text_hash": "fad7ddb8acf42b85d36155d2d3fb690085aeafb0ab723e538b5fbdbc860158a4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와여 땅의 열왕이 주께 감사할 것은 저희가 주의 입의 말씀을 들음이오며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "fad7ddb8acf42b85d36155d2d3fb690085aeafb0ab723e538b5fbdbc860158a4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:138:5",
      "sequence": 16237,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 138",
